  "notable_quotes": [
    "Structure 2 forms eight-membered channels along the a axis because both triazole and BDC bridge Zn polyhedra in the (011) plane.",
    "Structure 2 is thermally unstable: unlike 1 and 3, its framework quickly collapses when water molecules are removed on heating.",
    "Water molecules occupy framework cavities and likely hydrogen-bond to nearby carboxylates, with Ow···O-C distances of about 2.9 Å."
